%% src: output/FTA-reply-Ali-and-Sulieman.txt
flowchart TD
title FTA agent request flow - Ali execution approach
U([User question]) --> S[Supervisor Agent]
S --> D[Resolve domain and permissions]
D --> L[Load section instructions]
M[Model logic and mappings] --> PLAIN[Prepare reviewed plain language]
PLAIN --> I[Versioned section instructions]
I -.->|load first| L
L --> P[Build execution plan]
P --> V{Plan valid?}
V -->|yes| W[Workflow scheduler]
V -->|no| X([Clarify or reject])
W --> SEM[Semantic subgraph]
W --> ML[ML subgraph: guidance and evidence]
W --> RAG[RAG subgraph]
SEM --> C[Collect and validate results]
ML --> C
RAG --> C
SEM -.->|failure| F[Failure policy]
ML -.->|failure| F
RAG -.->|failure| F
F --> H([Bounded retry or human handoff])
C --> N{Investigation needed?}
N -->|yes| A[Investigation Agent]
N -->|no| R[Reporting Agent]
A --> R
A -.->|bounded replan| S
R --> O([Final response])
